model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "AppPages renders retained HTML with workerd's native parser and the shared portable URL, srcset and CSS rewrite policy. Attribute decoding uses the same pinned HTML parser dependency's decoder; decoding precedes URL rewriting and changed attributes escape ampersands before serialization. Portable hosts retain their parser. AppPages supplies cryptography and path services only: remote assets and bound app runtimes require no local filesystem, process or terminal services. Production upload checks reject the portable HTML engine and those local OS modules. Worker upload and startup budgets stay unchanged."
    }
  }
}
